# Q33: a row whose receiver has no fn: in its impl source refuses at the edge, located:
# "no converter body ported".  The row size_t -> int of convert.lm2 names
# lm_stg_convert_size_t_int.  The harness stages this fixture beside unit_s7_conv_nobody_impl.lm2
# as its convert_impl.lm2, which has no such fn:.  Beside the shared convert_impl.lm2 the same
# program translates and returns 2 (unit_s7_prim_cross).
fn: go () int
    int: a 1
    size_t: b 2U
    a: b
    return: a

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: go(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
